                                "sense_id": "3a5b3b26-b1dd-30da-9c2e-9d014351873c",
                                "text": "This necessary counterpoise, the affectionate and simple-minded will readily conceive, would arise to Louisa from the absence of those \"dear familiar faces\" which had hitherto constituted her world."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd0b8226-065f-3c6d-848f-d81a28772079",
